//! Gas-measurement wrappers: one tiny contract per verifier family that feeds calldata to the
//! fe_zk library verifier with the fixture's verifying-key constants. Built and measured by
//! scripts/gas-table.sh; not part of the fe_zk ingot. Fixture constant modules `fx_*.fe` are copied
//! from `src/tests/` by the script (they are generated by `scripts/gen-*-fixtures.py` there).
//!
//! Calldata is the plain ABI encoding of the message fields (static arrays, no offsets), the same
//! words the reference Solidity verifier of that family receives.
